        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>人民日报 金句合集系列</title>\n<script src=\"https://polyfill.io/v3/polyfill.min.js?features=es6\"></script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    background: #cfcac0;\n    font-family: \"Songti SC\", \"SimSun\", \"STSong\", serif;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: center;\n  }\n  .page {\n    width: 540px;\n    background: #d8d0c0;\n    position: relative;\n  }\n  /* ===== Header zone ===== */\n  .header {\n    background: #efe6d4;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    padding: 8px 14px 10px 18px;\n    height: 148px;\n  }\n  .masthead {\n    width: 270px;\n  }\n  .masthead .cn {\n    color: #b32017;\n    font-size: 54px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    letter-spacing: 2px;\n    line-height: 1.15;\n    font-family: \"Kaiti SC\", \"KaiTi\", \"STKaiti\", serif;\n  }\n  .masthead .pinyin {\n    color: #b32017;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    letter-spacing: 4px;\n    text-align: center;\n    margin-top: 6px;\n  }\n  .header-right {\n    width: 210px;\n    text-align: right;\n    padding-top: 6px;\n  }\n  .tagline {\n    font-size: 19px;\n    color: #1a1a1a;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n  }\n  .tagline span { padding: 0 4px; }\n  .series {\n    margin-top: 34px;\n    border-top: 2px solid #1a1a1a;\n    border-bottom: 2px solid #1a1a1a;\n    padding: 6px 4px;\n    font-size: 20px;\n    letter-spacing: 2px;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n  /* ===== Body zone ===== */\n  .content {\n    padding: 18px 22px 26px 22px;\n  }\n  .entry { margin-bottom: 14px; }\n  .quote {\n    font-size: 27px;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n    color: #14110f;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n    font-family: \"Kaiti SC\", \"KaiTi\", \"STKaiti\", serif;\n  }\n  .quote .line2 {\n    display: block;\n    padding-left: 42px;\n  }\n  .note-label {\n    font-size: 13px;\n    margin-top: 10px;\n    margin-bottom: 2px;\n    color: #2a2622;\n  }\n  .note {\n    font-size: 14.5px;\n    line-height: 1.6;\n    color: #2a2622;\n    letter-spacing: 0.5px;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <div class=\"header\">\n    <div class=\"masthead\">\n      <div class=\"cn\">人民日报</div>\n      <div class=\"pinyin\">RENMIN RIBAO</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"header-right\">\n      <div class=\"tagline\">金句<span>|</span>素材<span>|</span>摘抄</div>\n      <div class=\"series\">金句合集系列</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"content\">\n\n    <div class=\"entry\">\n      <div class=\"quote\">\n        1、愿你千山暮雪海棠依旧，\n        <span class=\"line2\">不为岁月惊扰平添忧愁。</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"note-label\">释义:</div>\n      <div class=\"note\">\n        希望你不论经过多少事都能如往昔依然不变,不因为时间的流逝与琐事而烦恼忧愁。\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"entry\">\n      <div class=\"quote\">\n        2、总有人间一两风，\n        <span class=\"line2\">填我十万八千梦。</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"note-label\">释义:</div>\n      <div class=\"note\">\n        人间总有那么几处善良和美好的事情，满足你对世界的所有遐想，成全你的理想。\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"entry\">\n      <div class=\"quote\">\n        3、日出有盼， 日落有思，\n        <span class=\"line2\">平平安安， 所遇皆甜。</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"note-label\">释义:</div>\n      <div class=\"note\">\n        只要日出就会有盼头，只要有日落就会有思念，祈祷大家平平安安，遇到的都是美好。\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
